   "marks": 5,
   "state": "SUGGESTED",
   "qnum": null,
   "stem_len": 69,
   "stem": "In 1937 an airship full of hydrogen gas flew from Germany to America."
  },
  {
   "id": "d80c0eed-0a86-4af7-b268-9bb0c4923523",
   "marks": 5,
   "state": "SUGGESTED",
   "qnum": null,
   "stem_len": 231,
   "stem": "The reactions of metals with water and with dilute sulfuric acid can be used to determine the order of reactivity of the metals. The table shows the reactions of four metals, W, X, Y and Z, with water and with dilute sulfuric acid."
  },
  {
   "id": "f9537fc2-fba7-4a1c-820b-1b0d4e3ae98b",
   "marks": 6,
   "state": "SUGGESTED",
   "qnum": null,
   "stem_len": 166,
   "stem": "Diamond, graphite and silicon dioxide all have giant covalent structures. The diagram shows the structures of these three substances. diamond graphite silicon dioxide"
  },
  {
   "id": "20da972a-faca-42d1-869f-eb5bc2b3d607",
   "marks": 6,
   "state": "SUGGESTED",
   "qnum": null,
   "stem_len": 175,
   "stem": "Ethene $ \\left( \\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{4} \\right) $ can be converted into chloroethene $ \\left( \\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{3} \\mathrm{Cl} \\right) $ in a two-stage process."
