   "marks": 6,
   "state": "SUGGESTED",
   "qnum": null,
   "stem_len": 137,
   "stem": "Halon 1301 is a compound used in some fire extinguishers. Halon 1301 has the percentage composition by mass of C 8.05% Br 53.69% F 38.26%"
  },
  {
   "id": "aa7692ec-07b3-409c-bcab-a183ab0e3cf7",
   "marks": 1,
   "state": "SUGGESTED",
   "qnum": null,
   "stem_len": 277,
   "stem": "(a) There are three isomers with the molecular formula $ \\mathrm{C_{5} H_{1 2}} $ One of these isomers is pentane. The displayed formula for pentane is (i) State what is meant by the term isomers. (ii) Draw the displayed formula for another isomer of $ \\mathrm{C_{5} H_{1 2}} $"
